## Common first-day questions

**Where did my Safari bookmark go?**  
Bookmarks (`⌘3`) are separate from Read Later (`⌘2`). Check both, or search the command palette for the title.

**Why is Archive not on a shortcut?**  
Archive is palette-driven by design. Use `⌘K` → “Archive” or the actions palette. Delete (`⌘⌫`) is the destructive action with a shortcut.

**Can I use Cardmaniacs without feeds?**  
Yes. Quick Add, Share extension, and document import work without any RSS subscriptions.

